  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "LINES & DELIVERY\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 2, CC 49 to 64\n   1 Volume of the lines\n   2 Dynamic range of the lines\n   3 How often the range changes\n   4 Pace\n   5 Silence length\n   6 Breathing and speaking\n   7 Eating and speaking\n   8 Shapes in the scene\n   9 Tone of the line\n  10 Where the tone sits in the story\n  11 Time on each character\n  12 Cut rate in action\n  13 Emotion of the beat\n  14 suite: Quiet confession\n  15 suite: Breathing room\n  16 suite: Rapid-fire banter\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 2, CC 65 to 80\n   1 suite: Quiet last scene\n   2 pair: When the emotion changes, the angle height changes\n   3 pair: When the emotion changes, the move temper changes\n   4 pair: When volume rises, move speed rises\n   5 pair: When the talk gets fast, each line gets fewer big poses\n   6 pair: When a character gets nervous, they blink more\n   7 pair: When someone talks with their mouth full, the voice needs cleaning up\n   8 pair: When a character eats before answering, the chew becomes a pause\n   9 pair: When action cuts come faster, more sound hits glue them together\n  10 pair: When the frame is crowded with shapes, the audience feels restless\n  11 pair: When the story reaches its climax, the sound gets loud\n  12 pair: When a line swings from whisper to shout, the shout pushes the mix to its limit\n  13 pair: When the story reaches its ending, the sound fades out\n  14 pair: When a line is whispered, the other sounds fall away\n  15 pair: When a voice breaks, the beat turns sad\n  16 pair: When every line swings to a new level, the character feels unstable\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 2, CC 81 to 86\n   1 pair: When the talk gets fast, the cutting speeds up to match\n   2 pair: When people talk over each other, the scene turns to comedy\n   3 pairs: Emotion steers the lens\n   4 pairs: Loudness and frame size\n   5 pairs: The volume curve\n   6 pairs: Talking fast"
   },
